### A8. The FP corpus has no INDEX, so each project rediscovers it `[SEVERITY: MEDIUM]`

**Evidence.** FP knowledge is spread across `fp_kill_protocol.md` (378 lines), `FP_HANDBOOK.md` (405), `community_fp_tips.md` (110), `FP_AUDIT_PING.md` (34), `/fix-fp` (32) — **959 lines, with real overlap and no map.** `/fix-fp` instructs "read `fp_kill_protocol.md` IN FULL" (70KB) but never mentions `FP_HANDBOOK.md`, which contains the lever equation that decides the whole fix.

