count as corpus evidence. **Still GLOBAL at 3, but on weaker evidence than I first wrote.** Existing-home: STEP 9. Provenance: EXECUTED-BY-ME. Cost-of-wrong: low; strictly more diverse evidence for
the same or less work. **VERDICT: ADOPT.**
**Scope note:** this critique covers **TRIPLE-CONFIRM**. I did **not** run the submit-time *5× model-mix
simulation* (2 Sonnet + 2 Opus + 1 master), so I make **no claim** about it — see Part 3.

