is worth keeping:** it marks the condition under which this defect does not apply — when the reference is solid
and the *suite* is the weak side, the reference-probe log costs time and returns nothing. Still the
best-evidenced defect in this file after A, at 7 of 11. Existing-home: the CLAUSE
